Route18_Text_WiltonIntro::
    .string "CYCLING ROAD throws everyone\n"
    .string "out here with hot wheels.\p"
    .string "Let's see if your team cooled\n"
    .string "down yet!$"

Route18_Text_WiltonDefeat::
    .string "Still running hot!$"

Route18_Text_WiltonPostBattle::
    .string "FUCHSIA gets quiet fast, but\n"
    .string "ROUTE 18 still has the pulse\l"
    .string "of CYCLING ROAD.$"

Route18_Text_RamiroIntro::
    .string "Cyclists barrel down from the\n"
    .string "north, so hold your line.\p"
    .string "Same goes for battling.$"

Route18_Text_RamiroDefeat::
    .string "I blinked first!$"

Route18_Text_RamiroPostBattle::
    .string "This little road catches all the\n"
    .string "momentum from the slope.\p"
    .string "Stand careless and it knocks\n"
    .string "you sideways.$"

Route18_Text_JacobIntro::
    .string "You want through to FUCHSIA?\p"
    .string "Show me you can handle the last\n"
    .string "stretch of the road.$"

Route18_Text_JacobDefeat::
    .string "Road's yours!$"

Route18_Text_JacobPostBattle::
    .string "The downhill rush from CELADON\n"
    .string "ends here by FUCHSIA.\p"
    .string "After this, the pace finally\n"
    .string "belongs to your feet again.$"

Route18_Text_LenaIntro::
    .string "I came out from FUCHSIA to watch\n"
    .string "the cyclists race by.\p"
    .string "A battle is even more exciting!$"

Route18_Text_LenaDefeat::
    .string "You were quick too!$"

Route18_Text_LenaPostBattle::
    .string "The city feels close here, even\n"
    .string "with the trees around us.\p"
    .string "You can hear FUCHSIA in the\n"
    .string "quiet between bikes.$"

Route18_Text_PaxtonIntro::
    .string "A short road still teaches you\n"
    .string "plenty if you pay attention.\p"
    .string "Lesson one: battle before you\n"
    .string "relax.$"

Route18_Text_PaxtonDefeat::
    .string "Lesson learned!$"

Route18_Text_PaxtonPostBattle::
    .string "I like training where town paths\n"
    .string "and open road meet.\p"
    .string "You get careful trainers and\n"
    .string "reckless riders in one place.$"

Route18_Text_RinaIntro::
    .string "I packed light.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 18 is all momentum,\n"
    .string "so you don't want loose bags!$"

Route18_Text_RinaDefeat::
    .string "Momentum gone!$"

Route18_Text_RinaPostBattle::
    .string "You can feel the whole road\n"
    .string "pointing toward FUCHSIA.$"

Route18_Text_LenaRematchIntro::
    .string "Back from FUCHSIA already?\p"
    .string "Good. I wanted another battle\n"
    .string "with the road rushing by!$"

Route18_Text_PaxtonRematchIntro::
    .string "Ready for lesson two?\p"
    .string "A short road can still teach\n"
    .string "you twice.$"

Route18_Text_RinaRematchIntro::
    .string "Still packed light?\p"
    .string "Then you're ready for another\n"
    .string "momentum battle!$"

Route18_Text_RouteSign::
    .string "ROUTE 18\n"
    .string "CELADON CITY - FUCHSIA CITY$"

Route18_Text_CyclingRoadSign::
    .string "CYCLING ROAD\n"
    .string "No pedestrians permitted!$"
